---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber off
    actor Admin
    participant Page as Admin site page<br/>SIR list
    participant Server as Server actions<br/>utils/supabase/queries.ts
    participant DB as Supabase DB<br/>form_responses, answers,<br/>attachments
    participant S3 as AWS S3

    Note over Admin,S3: Covers US 7.0.8. Delete first archives a SIR.<br/>Permanent deletion is available only from the archived reports page.

    Admin->>Page: Select Archive on a SIR
    Page->>Server: getSiteInspectionReportDeleteImpact(responseId)
    Server->>Server: requireApprovedAdmin():<br/>app_metadata.role = admin and authenticated
    Server->>DB: Count answers and attachments
    Page-->>Admin: Ask to confirm and explain that data is preserved (AT 1)
    Admin->>Page: Confirm archive
    Page->>Server: archiveSiteInspectionReport(responseId)
    Server->>Server: requireApprovedAdmin()
    alt Caller is not an approved Admin (AT 4)
        Server-->>Page: Refused. The SIR stays unchanged
    else Caller is an approved Admin
        Server->>DB: Lock report and set archived_at in one transaction
        alt Archive fails (AT 5)
            DB-->>Server: Error. Rollback
            Server-->>Page: Show error. Report data stays unchanged
        else Archive succeeds
            DB-->>Server: Archived
            Server-->>Page: Success
            Page-->>Admin: Remove SIR and its images from normal views (AT 2, AT 3)
        end
    end

    Admin->>Page: Open Archived Reports
    alt Restore
        Admin->>Page: Select Restore
        Page->>Server: restoreSiteInspectionReport(responseId)
        Server->>DB: Lock report and clear archived_at
        DB-->>Server: Restored with the old is_active value
        Server-->>Page: Remove report from archive list
    else Delete permanently
        Admin->>Page: Confirm permanent deletion
        Page->>Server: permanentlyDeleteSiteInspectionReport(responseId)
        Server->>Server: requireApprovedAdmin()
        Server->>DB: One transaction: require archived_at,<br/>capture storage keys, delete attachments,<br/>answers, and form_responses
        alt Transaction fails (AT 5)
            DB-->>Server: Error. Rollback
            Server-->>Page: Show error. Report data stays unchanged
        else Transaction succeeds
            DB-->>Server: Counts and storage keys
            Server->>S3: deleteObjectsByKeys(storage_keys)
            Note over DB,S3: PostgreSQL and S3 cannot share one transaction.<br/>An S3 failure is logged and shown as incomplete storage cleanup.
            Server-->>Page: Remove report from archive list
        end
    end
